  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">223430_FY25_WFP_Niger_Maradi Integrated Resilience</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Target Beneficiaries:
 
 
 
 57925
 
 
 
 
 
 Project Area: 
 
 
 
 Maradi Region / Guidan Roumdji Departement / (Chadakori, Guidan Sori and Guidan Roumdji Communes)
 
 
 
 
 
 Purpose/Objective: 
 
 
 
 General objective: Improve the food and nutritional situation of populations affected by armed conflicts, natural disasters or epidemics in the communes of Guidan Roumdji, through immediate basic assistance activities.
 
 Strategic objective 1: The food security of men and women through Cash assistance (monetary transfers) and food assistance activities is improved.
 
 Strategic objective 2: The nutritional situation of girls and boys aged 6 to 23 months with preventive supplementation through the distribution of nutritional products is improved</narrative>
  </description>
